# Prettier rewrites MDX expression comments -- {/* ... */} becomes {/_ ... _/},
# because it parses the asterisks as emphasis. That is not a style change: the
# result fails to compile, so `pnpm fmt` breaks the build on any MDX file
# carrying one. Until that is fixed upstream, keep those files out.
#
# The repo is a long way from prettier-clean overall (hundreds of files), so
# `fmt` is not run wholesale today -- but this at least makes the failure
# impossible rather than merely unlikely.
api/index.mdx

# Generated from the OpenAPI specs by `pnpm regen-api-docs`; reformatting them
# only produces churn that the next regeneration discards.
api/*.api.mdx
api/*.info.mdx
api/management/
